/** Encode/decode binary data using printable characters (base16 format - hex)
 *
 * @see RFC 4648 <http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc4648.txt>.
 *
 * @copyright 2021 Arran Cudbard-Bell (a.cudbardb@freeradius.org)
